  He appears abruptly, dropping from the ceiling. How long has he been there? Why did no one notice? 

  Even his own men are speechless. Of all of us, only Miss Nagakura is unshaken.

pt:
//　その男は、<RUBY text='・・・'>上から</RUBY>降ってきた。
